{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fight is coming to your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After boxing with you in VR with ARVIS Punch, and ARVIS Punch 2, our fighters are waiting to reach a bigger audience by removing the need of a headset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience a new and dynamic fight experience with our third-person perspective, and brand new animations that really PUNCH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills with all of our classic VR fighters like Mariano, or even Ultratumba; and get ready to face new challengers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your fighter and opponent carefully, as their speed, strength or reflexes can be the difference between a nice fight and a straight Knock Out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still finding our fighters too weak? Jump into multiplayer mode, where you will be able to prove your worth online and locally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So don't waste any time, get into ARVIS Knock Out! Select your fighter, hit the ring, and get that Knock Out!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670320?t=1766169551","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670320/86919804967ea77f1741e8cc458fd3e682438339/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766169551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670320/0a76f49a3b954178137821fd453873f323a50d8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766169551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670320/0a76f49a3b954178137821fd453873f323a50d8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766169551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":